    "title": "Xi meets European Council president, European Commission president in Beijing - Chinadaily.com.cn",
    "text": "BEIJING -- President Xi Jinping met with President of the European Council Antonio Costa and President of the European Commission Ursula von der Leyen in Beijing on Thursday.\n50 years of China-EU ties yield fruitful cooperation outcomes, benefit world: Xi\nXi calls on China, EU to provide more stability, certainty for world through steady, sound bilateral relations\nChinese, EU leaders should make right strategic choices that will meet people's expectations: Xi\nChina, EU are both constructive forces for multilateralism, openness and cooperation: Xi",
